  unitName: Nitro Grog Jake (EU)
  unitId: 730246
  unitNumber: 7199
  description: "There was always a huge rivalry between Voodoo Child and his younger
    brother. Ever since he was young, Jake played with different liquids in order
    to produce interesting effects. However, he had trouble concentrating due to
    the incessant noise of his brother\u2019s music, which caused Jake to have some
    explosive accidents. When Voodoo Child joined forces with Coal Cauldron, Jake
    chose another path. The latter\u2019s cruelty had always bothered Jake. After
    some years of perfecting his recipes, he created Nitro Grog: a cocktail that
    would explode when subjected to shock. Jake then joined forces with Blink\u2019s
    band in order to reason with his brother and put an end to the tyranny of Coal
    Cauldron."
  summonDesc: Are you thirsty, Summoner? I can serve you an explosive drink!
  fusionDesc: That's it! I've come up with a new explosive recipe!
